 				 * 0): a BLOCKED device gets a bare REAPER_GKI DROP. The DHCP /
 				 * DNS / captive RETURNs exist only in the quarantine tail, for
@@ -1844,7 +1891,7 @@ static void gen_witnesses(void)
 			} else if (lanonly) {
